      {
        "factor": "International norms and enforcement mechanisms raise costs of use",
        "direction": "down",
        "magnitude": "moderate",
        "rationale": "CWC norms, sanctions, and ongoing investigations exert deterrence that reduces the probability relative to an unconstrained scenario."
